<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>cascade</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
    <title>Cascade</title>
    <authors>Aric Camarata</authors>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/acamarata/cascade</projectUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/acamarata/cascade/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/acamarata/cascade</projectSourceUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/acamarata/cascade/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>ai claude instructions cascade developer-tools</tags>
    <summary>Unified AI instruction cascade manager for coding agents</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Cascade consolidates AI tool instruction files (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, .cursorrules, and others)
into a single tiered hierarchy that every tool reads automatically.

Write your rules once at the right scope and every AI coding tool picks them up consistently.
Includes the cascaded background daemon, cascade CLI, and an optional Tauri desktop GUI.

Features:
- 6-tier instruction hierarchy (GCI to PAC) for any working directory
- Local RAG index over your instruction corpus (FTS5 + embeddings + RRF), no cloud required
- MCP server exposing your cascade as context to any MCP-compatible tool
- WASM plugin system with a PDK and cargo-generate template
    ]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/acamarata/cascade/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
